WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:05.745
School setup wizard

00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:08.569
Open School Setup in the sidebar.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:17.532
The wizard walks through the setup in order, from the school profile to the final review.

00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:21.480
Complete a step, then press Next Step.

00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:27.905
Press Skip to leave a step for later.

00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:36.972
Press Exit Setup at any time. You can come back later.

00:00:37.948 --> 00:00:42.612
Set up step by step
